<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
An address ({{invitee}}) you invited to mediate in your market has accepted
your invitation.
<br><br>
They will be able to join as mediators with a valid ticket
holding your market's required minimum mediator bond.
<br><br>
<i style="color: #7f7f7f">Note: You can always revoke mediator's permission from
  the <a
    href="https://app.fiatx.co/mediation#invitations">invitation</a>page.</i>
<br><br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/mediation#invitations">View Invitations</a>
  </li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/market/{{marketId}}">View Market</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
